{"title":"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 41","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_41&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/4/cf4f01a89ca52739db7cb3f2578e1ae5eb8b1f96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Ax^2 + Bx + C = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"148\" height=\"16\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />. For the roots of\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/a/fcaf244c720b0a6333002d549f7ca97a81627a1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+px +q =0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/2/e2221c84f16a3f75ae07e5023384cc40d9c05357.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^2$\" width=\"14\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/2/752ccf51ef0be42644a0099346e876310df962f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> must equal:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/0/2104bd259353d9bfa71dc900600f875db2574c78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{B^2 - 4AC}{A^2}\\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{B^2 - 2AC}{A^2}\\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{2AC - B^2}{A^2}\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ B^2 - 2C\\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ 2C - B^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"423\" height=\"59\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_41&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By Vieta's, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/8/ac839b6c320fc007edb4b7ef83d1f7b056ea4641.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r + s = -\\frac{B}{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"98\" height=\"39\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/e/27e44c3e8f4390346b8ede37aeddb89bb26dcf97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$rs = \\frac{C}{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"58\" height=\"37\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/1259afbb300335ed4d7b9a92b781d03da1a32421.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^2 + s^2 = -p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"101\" height=\"18\" />. Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/0/f80ee28833aaa68b696a0c500763f1926c6090ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(r+s)^2 = r^2 + s^2 + 2rs$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"187\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/6/6d6fdd2a0089dff44f993ac5e55effb559289bf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(r + s)^2 - 2rs = r^2 + s^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"186\" height=\"19\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/4/a64a0eedce1eb2290f68018c27afdf8259e6a83a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\left(\\frac{B}{A}\\right)^2 - \\frac{2C}{A} = -p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"168\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p>Simplifying, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/f/d6f62d10f99c56532d72f22b68cb1872a597a8e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{B^2 - 2CA}{A^2} = -p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"132\" height=\"39\" />. \n</p><p>Finally, multiply both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/a/ceaa0d8414ed34e3bd046446580892842d83743d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = \\frac{2CA - B^2}{A^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"118\" height=\"39\" />, making the answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/7/ef7ef72cd47d554d4b473d7e68935e75a19c0e7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"25\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_41&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME\" title=\"1958 AHSME\">1958 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1958 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1958\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 40\">Problem 40</a></b>\n</td>\n<